{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st05","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_04","title":"登陸點","storyCode":"SN-ST-5","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st05.txt","sourceHash":"62971c24d049b69ee1a85abfb5645f2b524080f29056dc7cdd8d4896708e6141","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"留在小鎮的卡門與凱爾希試圖在懲戒軍抵達之前清理邪教徒，搭建前線陣地。前往大燈塔的海域並非一帆風順，獵人們不得不直面恐魚的威脅——以及一位神秘來客。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......這些，噁心的地面，是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這些恐魚嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿瑪雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？這些深海教徒，你不是說他們不會出現嗎？他們把這裡弄得一團糟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈，我是來道別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時候差不多了，而現在機會難得，我只是這麼覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官已經到了。足足三位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪在他們手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，蒂亞戈。喬迪是以自己的意志回到的這裡。三名審判官，你能做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他知不知道被審判庭發現意味著什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說過很多次，我想他應該知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但人就是這樣。趨利避害只是邏輯推論得出的結果，人複雜得多，而這種複雜不能被輕易評判......我不會說喬迪愚蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在可不是當道德家的時候——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們談論的是性質，而非道德，蒂亞戈鎮長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人之性具有美感。連時間都否定不了這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你到底要說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你憎恨審判庭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐魚確實遍佈小鎮，但是，蒂亞戈，回憶一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個雨夜，那些懲戒軍，他們闖入鎮上，撕碎房門。慘叫不絕於耳，蓋過淅瀝瀝的雨點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，別說了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——現在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海的痕跡蔓延在這座小鎮上——你聽見慘叫了嗎？你看到無理由的殺戮或狩獵了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的格蘭法洛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——徒留靜謐而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋原來，這麼廣闊......"},{"type":"narration","text":"海風吹過。\n喬迪不可置信地看著眼前的一切。他本以為海平線就是天空的終點。\n直到親眼確認這無限延伸的浪潮時——喬迪——這個阿戈爾人突然產生了一個疑惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼人類從來沒有過探索它的欲望呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......除非星星是有規律的地圖，或者雙月能變成信號塔，否則我們怎麼才能在這一片汪洋上確認方位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，星星是沒有規律的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去問專業的天文學家好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果......阿戈爾真的在海面以下，那阿戈爾究竟有多大......比伊比利亞還要大嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊有幾個真正的阿戈爾人，你要不要去問問看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們好像都有心事的樣子，一臉嚴肅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚，你在聽什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海風中夾雜著親緣的饋贈，讓我......很安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"越接近海洋，她越是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"在鹽風城的時候她明明......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道原因嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的猜測只會干擾你的判斷，我們的眼前是戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僥倖上岸之後，你有試過回到海洋嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，然後失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"它們無窮無盡，包圍著我，我只是遊出去沒多遠就失去了力氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我試了很多很多次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都清楚我們自己身上發生的變化，斯卡蒂。你也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚雖然遭受了一些傷害，但她是我的獵人，她才不會那麼脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她與我們是一樣的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"“幽靈鯊”，曾是深海教會的受害者。源石，這種東西不存在於海洋，對她產生了各種影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"為何要帶著這樣的不確定因素？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回家，與你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"家？但是阿戈爾的情況不會比伊比利亞好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提起你的燈，審判官。先準備迎接敵人吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，它們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"深海獵人真只有三人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果還有別人，我早該找到他們才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼這麼問？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"突然出現的恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（詭異的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"航向準確嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"無誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......靠近伊比利亞之眼後，恐魚展現出了更明確的敵意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡興許已是它們的巢穴，在船上纏鬥實在浪費時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，鯊魚，你們保護這艘船，也順便看著點那些原始的信號導航設備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去海裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在海裡更強，但它們也是。而且我們不能在海裡流血，那太危險。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼了？！又有怪物襲擊了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，看不見！我們不知道水下發生了什麼，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉悶的轟鳴......！下面發生了什麼？她在下面戰鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是在......移動。畢竟在水裡，她更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在水裡怎麼可能比在空氣中速度還快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"習慣吧，或者是技巧一類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"恐魚隨她去了。她開闢了一條道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"艾麗妮，你帶著布雷奧甘的後裔繼續掌舵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"速度快，在敵人包圍我們之前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他們已經出發了，海上不會平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果擔心他們，我們就趕緊完成我們的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蘭法洛本就是收復燈塔的前哨，我們要做的只是重拾這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞竟然已經能夠利用阿戈爾的技術抵禦溟痕的入侵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們進化的速度快過任何一位科學家的大腦，要贏，就要不擇手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕動用了一支軍隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是座不起眼的小鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許有更多的戰略重地等著審判庭一一收復。更好的作戰地點，更宏偉的高牆與碉堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，有時候，從手邊事做起，也不是什麼壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少伊比利亞人願意與浪潮廝殺至死，我們就有多少人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，開始掃除吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（持續的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂......我們還沒到嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按、按照海圖，我們至少已經能看見它了才對啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！再深入下去，恐怕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"抬頭看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i27"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？明明黑漆漆一片，我什麼都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......那不是......那不是天空，那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡已是它們的巢穴。離海岸很近，難怪那些恐魚數量如此之多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"砍完就可以了吧。像以前那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對，像以前那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是......他們的眼睛？為什麼我能感覺到如此熟悉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它蒙於污穢許久，早已睜不開眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我來開路。喬迪，你跟我們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。好、好......希望我能幫上忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是你必須要做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，我們會轉變戰略，優先確保審判庭的技術人員能安全抵達這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"在這場戰役中，我們無暇顧及一個自說自話的阿戈爾人的死活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎很著急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾人。你不明白重新抵達這座島嶼的意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......從懲戒軍發現燈塔殘存的訊號至今，我們十七次試圖登陸這裡，其中有八次成功踩上這片礁石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數百名戰士，三位審判官，沒有人活著回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道阿戈爾的優越道德，教你們放棄對英雄的尊重與緬懷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官和我......伊比利亞人會為那些葬身大海的亡魂祭奠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無意對你們的道德挑三揀四。只是，面對海洋，我們勢單力薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請便吧，但我們時間緊迫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"踏上礁石。\n巨物躲藏在漆黑的風中，只有抬頭凝視，才能從一片昏沉的天空裡將它分辨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i27"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊比利亞之眼。\n一雙緊閉的眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好高......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那座小鎮上的雕塑，比例尺一定標錯了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就是，我們曾經的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也是，第一次親眼目睹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"二人無言片刻，駐足打量著這僅存於文獻與記錄中的恢宏景象。\n伊比利亞堅韌的現實仍舊超過她被教育的那般，艾麗妮如此想到。儘管那些深海獵人對他們滿懷不屑，儘管國家的平衡確實在崩潰。\n但這座燈塔就像是一個象徵。關於過去的風聲與野心。關於欲望與對未知的桀驁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論你此刻心中翻湧著什麼情感，銘記它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些建築，這些破損的劍與燈，這些礁石，這片海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要把人類究竟在鬥爭中建立了什麼銘記在心，時時刻刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若不敬畏犧牲，天秤則無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心前進吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回家了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不，還沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果我們在這裡找到了凱爾希和二隊長要找的，也許可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"忍耐一下吧......就快了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡太安靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"明明都是惡臭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，礁石上滿是溟痕的殘留，能看見一些人造物的痕跡，大都腐朽了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭緩步輕踱，抬首望向延伸向昏黑天空的高塔。\n伊比利亞之眼向天指去，就好像在這有限的土地上，生命伸長脖頸，想看見未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陸上諸國竭盡全力複製出了布雷奧甘留下的遺產，這些所謂燈塔，盡是對阿戈爾技術的模仿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這空無一物的大海上，這座燈塔又在等著什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它究竟是看著海洋，還是看著陸地呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"二隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。這裡本就是恐魚的巢穴，它們沒有立刻出現，也許只是一種防禦性的護巢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們也該來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（詭異的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"數量......不算多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"海，這裡已經看不見海岸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懷念嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不......只是在說，我們不能流血。在這裡，會很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們還刺不穿我們的肌膚。只要不停下你的舞步，這些數量，還不足以殺死我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（燈塔......果然和小鎮上那座雕像一模一樣。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（也就是說，家裡的那些圖紙，確實是爸媽留下的伊比利亞之眼的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我的父母曾經......就是在這裡......）"},{"type":"narration","text":"喬迪回頭望向海洋。\n每一天，他都會回想起自己所見到的那片灰濛濛的海岸。沒有活力的顏色，沒有希望的人群。\n可是，啊，看看這座燈塔吧，喬迪這麼想到。\n蒂亞戈叔叔說得對，他們都是英雄，他們本該偉大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......深海獵人們應該就在不遠處休整，她們也會參與戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了在鹽風城所見到的，她們的血很特殊，凱爾希並沒有向審判庭全盤托出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明、明白，所以她們是不能信任的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你在審判庭地下看到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“海嗣”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你應當還記得它的扭曲，它的生命力，它的......平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"在鹽風城，她們曾與那樣的怪物為敵，並獲得勝利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經見過真相了，那就重新審視你的過去和伊比利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"撕毀腦海裡的舊景！得出你自己的判決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——（摩擦礁石的窸窣聲）——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"它們已經準備好了。退守巢穴，伺機而動，現在來驅趕外敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪，情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！真是奇跡，外面這些控制台還有反應，但我不清楚這些東西的驅動原理是什麼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我在找！我包裡帶著家裡的那些研究筆記！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......動作快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道！是這本......不、不對......咿，這本怎麼被弄濕了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！它們來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"narration","text":"波濤洶湧。\n水面掀起數十米高的傲慢，日復一日地破碎，屈服於礁石與三個月亮。\n一個月亮明亮。一個月亮晦暗。這是亙古的月亮，掛在天上。\n剩下一輪月色，來自海浪的間隙，浪峰的頂端。\n月光來自他曾信仰的名號。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
